OL,3,GNEWSA'You're made to feel like a
OL,4,Acriminal' - cancer survivor screamed at
OL,5,Afor stoma at airport
OL,6,
OL,7,FA cancer survivor said he was screamed
OL,8,Fat by airport security staff and "made
OL,9,Fto feel like a criminal" after trying
OL,10,Fto retrieve his stoma supplies from his
OL,11,Fluggage.
OL,13,FPaul Scanlon, from Cardiff, has had a
OL,14,Fstoma for nearly four years after being
OL,15,Fdiagnosed with stage three bowel cancer
OL,16,Fand said he had suffered "degrading"
OL,17,Fand "humiliating" treatment at UK
OL,18,Fairports.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
