OL,3,GNEWSA'You're made to feel like a
OL,4,Acriminal' - cancer survivor screamed at
OL,5,Afor stoma at airport
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt has led a charity to call for better
OL,8,Ftraining for airport staff, so people
OL,9,Fwith stomas are treated with "dignity"
OL,10,Fand "respect".
OL,12,FThe UK Civil Aviation Authority (CAA)
OL,13,Fsaid airports must ensure staff had
OL,14,Fdisability awareness training and that
OL,15,Fsecurity officers were expected to
OL,16,Ftreat people in a "sensitive and
OL,17,Funderstanding" way.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
